OL,3,GNEWSACity council leader's warning to
OL,4,ADebenhams owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Nottingham City Council
OL,7,Fhas called on the owners of a landmark
OL,8,Fbuilding "to take their
OL,9,Fresponsibilities seriously" as measures
OL,10,Fto secure the site are set to be
OL,11,Fextended.
OL,13,FA closure order on the former Debenhams
OL,14,Fbuilding in Long Row is now expected to
OL,15,Fbe extended past 20 November, after one
OL,16,Fwas first issued by magistrates in
OL,17,FDecember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
