OL,3,GNEWSACity council leader's warning to
OL,4,ADebenhams owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe department store closed in May
OL,7,F2021, and has been prone to break-ins
OL,8,Fby youths and so-called urban
OL,9,Fexplorers, said the Local Democracy
OL,10,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,12,FNeghat Khan said: "Nottingham deserves
OL,13,Fbetter than an empty, unsafe building
OL,14,Fat the heart of its city centre."
